category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libglib2.0-devel libgmp-devel libguile3.0-devel libsodium-devel
sdesc: "Yet Another Crypto Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Basically this is my wrapper around a much better library (libsodium) with
some functions that libsodium doesn't include. In general, the libsodium
routines are used with the exception of the algorithms not in NaCl."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/cryptotronix/yacl
license: BSD-2-Clause AND BSD-3-Clause
